description:
**DXC Technology 概況 DXC Technology(紐 約證券交易所代碼:**DXC) 是位列美國財富 500 強 的全球 IT 服務領導者。DXC 幫助 全球企業建設、實施其核 心關鍵業務系統並提供營 運支援,同時實現 IT 數 碼化轉型、優化資料架構, 並確保跨公有雲端、私有 雲端和混合雲端的安全性 和可擴展性。 DXC Technology 由 電 腦 科 學 公 司(「CSC」) 和慧與公司(「HPE」)企 業服務業務部門於 2017 年 4 月 合 併 重 組 成 立。 在 70 多個國家 / 地 區 擁有超過 130,000 名 員 工, 為 230 多個財富 500 強和全球領先的企 業 客戶提 供 服 務。



**職責描述:**  

Ø Responsible for the ongoing operation and management of Data Centre, network support for the hosting service;



**任職要求:**  

Ø At least 9 years of IT working experience;



Ø At least 4 years of computer networking experience in a supervisory role.



Ø At least two (2\\) years of IT working experience in data centre operation management. Working experience in site preparation is desirable;



Ø Valid certification of Cisco Certified Network Professional (CCNP) or Cisco Certified Design Professional (CCDP) or Cisco Certified Internetwork Expert (CCIE) or equivalent Cisco certification; and



Ø Good communication skills (oral and in writing) in both Chinese and English.



Full\\-time,Permanent

Technical Engineer

Job Description



Helping Enterprises and Governments implement and deploy our Digital Transformation solutions, and providing ongoing support;



As Technical Support, you will be responsible for solving customer technical issues concerning their implementation of our software;



Write unit test cases, including extreme cases, usability, and reliability tests.



Skills \\& Requirements



College or University graduate;



Knowledge and experience in ECM/DMS , BPM and Workflow solutions in advantages;



Knowledge and experience in Linux and MS networks are a MUST, e.g. Red Hat, Ubuntu, Elastic Search, MariaDB, MangoDB or MSSQL, MS Windows, MS Exchange;



Knowledge in Python, Java, Vue and JQuery is an advantage;



Experience in writing system documentation;



Good command of both written and spoken English and Chinese (Cantonese and Mandarin);



Immediate availability in an advantage.



Software/Technical Consultant

Job Description



Providing Pre\\-sales and Post\\-sales of OceanX ECM Suite Digital Transformation solutions to Government \\& Enterprises;



As Technical Support, you will be responsible for solving customer technical issues concerning their implementation of our software;



Write unit test cases, including extreme cases, usability, and reliability tests.

Skills \\& Requirements



University graduate;



Knowledge and experience in ECM/DMS , BPM and Workflow solutions in advantages;



At least 5 years of experience in Linux \\& MS products, e.g. Red Hat, Ubuntu, Elastic Search, MariaDB, MangoDB or MSSQL, MS Windows, MS Exchange;



Knowledge in Python, Java, Vue and JQuery is preferred;



Strong problem\\-solving, communication and interpersonal skills;



Good Analytical and Presentation Skill;



Experience in writing system documents;



Good command of both written and spoken English and Chinese (Cantonese and Mandarin);



Immediate availability is an advantage.



**Interest parities please send resume with expected salary to:** Personnel Manager, 2602 Yen Sheng Centre, 64 Hoi Yuen Road, Kwun Tong, Kowloon, Hong Kong or fax to 2690 0032 or email to personnel\\-active. com.hk. Web\\-site: www.active.com.hk



Active e\\-Solution Limited

The Leading Solution Provider with 30 Years of Experience.

Founded in 1993, Active e\\-Solution Limited is the leading solution provider of Business Process and Digital Transformation Solution. The company provides the one\\-stop IT solutions for major government departments and commercial organizations. The solutions mainly include Enterprise content Management, Business Process Management (BPM/Workflow), Document Management (DMS), Customer Relationship Management (CRM) and Enterprise Fax Server. Besides solutions, the company also provides comprehensive IT services, including consultancy and planning, implementation and integration, user training and maintenance.

Active highly values customers and has built up a solid customer base. To date, more than half of Hong Kong Top 1000 companies have chosen our solutions and services.

The company is headquartered in Hong Kong and has sets up branch offices in Shenzhen and Shanghai.



All applications applied through our system will be delivered directly to the advertiser and privacy of personal data of the applicant will be ensured with security.



Full\\-time

